# name: test_doctor_prints_what_to_fix_and_exits_with_one
  '''
  ✓ ffmpeg        version 8.0.1-3ubuntu2
  ✗ libass        not built in                                                                        
                  fix: This ffmpeg was built without libass, which is needed to render subtitles.     
                  Install a build with libass (most distribution packages have it).                   
  ✗ encoders      incomplete                                                               
                  fix: ffmpeg has no libx264 encoder. Install an ffmpeg build with libx264.
  ✗ fdkaac        not found                                                                           
                  fix: Install fdkaac (for example 'sudo apt install fdkaac' or 'brew install         
                  fdk-aac'), or set audio.encoder to ffmpeg-aac to use ffmpeg's own AAC encoder.      
  ✓ PyTorch       2.14.1+cpu, CUDA none
  ! GPU           none found                                                                          
                  note: PyTorch finds no CUDA GPU (this is a CPU build of PyTorch). On a machine with 
                  an NVIDIA GPU and its driver, run 'make env TORCH_EXTRA=cuda'. Otherwise the        
                  separation runs on the CPU, about 20 times slower.                                  
  ✗ models        0 of 3 present; bs-roformer-leap (missing), bs-roformer-karaoke (missing),          
                  wav2vec2-en (missing)                                                               
                  fix: Run 'vocatron models download bs-roformer-leap bs-roformer-karaoke             
                  wav2vec2-en'.                                                                       
  ✗ output folder /work/karaoke cannot be written                                                   
                  fix: Choose another folder with --output or output.folder, or fix its permissions.
  5 of 8 checks need attention
  
  '''
# ---
